 "summary": {
  "headline": "Q1 FY27 revenue rose ~44% YoY to INR1,890 crore and reported EBITDA rose ~87% to INR71.5 crore (3.8% margin), with reported PBT turning positive at INR1.9 crore.",
  "overview": "Revenue from operations grew about 44% YoY to INR1,890 crore, with new vehicle volumes up about 81% reported and about 91% like-to-like. Reported EBITDA rose about 87% to INR71.5 crore, margin 3.8% vs 2.9%, helped by a one-off ~INR5 crore lease-modification gain in other income. Organic revenue grew 33% YoY, indicating the existing network contributed alongside the FY26 acquisitions (RKS Maruti, Globe CV BharatBenz, Audi/Olympus). Management said the acquired businesses are now EBITDA-positive in aggregate (~INR9.4 crore) but still loss-making below EBITDA due to depreciation and finance costs; reported PAT was INR1.4 crore vs a loss of INR8.8 crore a year ago.</overview>\n<parameter name=\"financial_highlights\">[{\"metric\":\"Revenue from operations / total income\",\"value\":\"INR1,890 crore (total income INR1,903.1 crore)\",\"change\":\"+44.6% YoY (reported); +52% like-to-like; +33% organic\"},{\"metric\":\"Reported EBITDA\",\"value\":\"INR71.5 crore\",\"change\":\"+86.6% YoY\"},{\"metric\":\"EBITDA margin\",\"value\":\"3.8%\",\"change\":\"vs 2.9% in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"Adjusted EBITDA (ex acquisition/divestment effects)\",\"value\":\"INR62 crore\",\"change\":\"~+82% YoY\"},{\"metric\":\"Reported PBT\",\"value\":\"INR1.9 crore\",\"change\":\"vs loss of INR11 crore in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"Adjusted PBT\",\"value\":\"INR11.2 crore\",\"change\":\"\"},{\"metric\":\"Reported PAT\",\"value\":\"INR1.4 crore\",\"change\":\"vs loss of INR8.8 crore in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"Finance cost (per Q&A)\",\"value\":\"~INR30 crore\",\"change\":\"\"}]",
